      "parent_complete_review_sha256": "38520d071c80589aa5fd2b9754068e4769ca273660635a433fe6e8e283ed5a90",
      "paired_excerpts": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "document": "agent/research/portfolio-vivabem-20261120/cobra-validation-context-candidate-v2/en.md",
          "document_sha256": "7a80c02bedc1aafdfab8ec73ef900b59e8f397787e757b324c61690759e6fcc6",
          "lines": [
            46,
            46
          ],
          "exact_markdown_excerpt": "**Does an empty ValidArgs list itself reject input?** No. In the selected `OnlyValidArgs` body, membership validation is inside the nonempty-list guard and the subsequent return is `nil`.\n",
          "excerpt_sha256": "259af3f548704a983ec74fb8e125c9bae0888d30352337b7a7809425179800b5"
        },
        {
          "language": "pt-BR",
          "document": "agent/research/portfolio-vivabem-20261120/cobra-validation-context-candidate-v2/pt-BR.md",
          "document_sha256": "3d24eeaa8186522bcc891ecaa043653d01c0a1f2c6085c1d4d65de8680a26a72",
          "lines": [
            46,
            46
          ],
          "exact_markdown_excerpt": "**Uma lista ValidArgs vazia, por si só, rejeita entradas?** Não. No corpo selecionado de `OnlyValidArgs`, a validação de pertencimento fica dentro da condição de lista não vazia, e o retorno seguinte é `nil`.\n",
          "excerpt_sha256": "aa88582ceea22ce2c1b56ef95f9e39961d9cc2b74b3cbeb536c1e665f0275b43"
        }
      ],
