      "id": "documentation-review-zod-faq-boundary",
      "repository": "zod",
      "source_family": "colinhacks/zod",
      "current_role": "DEVELOPMENT_EXPOSED_CURRENT_CAMPAIGN",
      "topic": "truthy replacement affects lazy error construction",
      "parent_complete_review": "agent/research/portfolio-vivabem-20261120/zod-safe-parse-complete-document-review-v2.json",
      "parent_complete_review_sha256": "2092ebb0f0594a21f7a8334c31715e740961e8986ff7f0de053dde6efe39330c",
      "paired_excerpts": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "document": "agent/research/portfolio-vivabem-20261120/zod-safe-parse-candidate-v2/en.md",
          "document_sha256": "0d40db3e7aaad54f8299b670775d5c47b11291686bf6587a3fb625ddda937bbe",
          "lines": [
            52,
            52
          ],
          "exact_markdown_excerpt": "**Can a replacement affect the later error read?** Yes, the written setter assigns the supplied value and clears its captures. A truthy replacement can make the getter return that value without constructing through `Err`; this is a source-level condition, not a guarantee about every untyped caller.\n",
          "excerpt_sha256": "3b48c563ede57055072bb921682a654be4e73f936a51fe7d2386f0992b001593"
        },
        {
          "language": "pt-BR",
          "document": "agent/research/portfolio-vivabem-20261120/zod-safe-parse-candidate-v2/pt-BR.md",
          "document_sha256": "065364f678164d05944cea1a6daf79e9983cda9f02fd0048d534a15466fa73d1",
          "lines": [
            52,
            52
          ],
          "exact_markdown_excerpt": "**Uma substituição pode afetar a leitura posterior do erro?** Sim, o setter escrito atribui o valor fornecido e limpa suas capturas. Uma substituição truthy pode fazer o getter retornar esse valor sem construir por `Err`; essa é uma condição descrita no código, não uma garantia sobre todo chamador sem tipos.\n",
          "excerpt_sha256": "69645d85ee8a5ad32d1eb9631235d20611c242f011329de3cb83d79aef40f8bf"
        }
      ],
      "source_evidence": [
